Alembic migrations for insight-alpha.

Usage:
  # Paper DB
  export DATABASE_URL_PAPER="postgresql://..."
  EXECUTION_MODE=paper alembic upgrade head

  # Live DB
  export DATABASE_URL_LIVE="postgresql://..."
  EXECUTION_MODE=live alembic upgrade head

  # One-off URL (overrides env)
  alembic -x url="postgresql://..." upgrade head

Generate a new revision after editing src/storage/models.py:
  EXECUTION_MODE=paper alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
